    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Hamill Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the sales market 6 Clanmoyle Road, Donnycarney, Dublin 5. This attractive three-bedroom property extending to approx. 82.5 sq m is ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac, overlooking a large communal green area, and offers well-proportioned accommodation together with a wonderful landscaped rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, the welcoming entrance hall leads into the main living accommodation. To the front is a bright and comfortable living room featuring a charming fireplace with timber surround and gas fire inset, creating a warm and inviting focal point to the room. Off the living room is a modern, fully tiled shower room, providing excellent convenience for residents and guests.\r\n\r\nThe living room leads through to the impressive open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen extension is particularly bright and airy, with two Velux roof window’s flooding the space with natural light. The layout provides an excellent setting for both everyday family living and entertaining. Patio doors from the kitchen open directly onto the rear patio area, creating a seamless connection between the indoor and outdoor spaces.\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three bedrooms, two large double bedrooms and a generous single bedroom. The master bedroom benefits from its own ensuite facility and built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property enjoys a large, landscaped and fully walled rear garden, with a patio area providing an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining. The garden with its easterly orientation backs onto Clontarf Golf Club, creating a particularly attractive setting. To the front, there is a cobble-lock driveway providing off-street parking. The property is further enhanced by its position within a quiet cul-de-sac, with a large green area to the front.\r\n\r\nSituated approximately 5km from Dublin City Centre, the area is popular with families, first-time buyers and .  The nearby coastal areas of Clontarf and Dublin Bay provide excellent opportunities for walking, cycling and enjoying the outdoors.  The location is a major attraction adjoining Parnell Park and Clontarf Golf Club, while a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and recreational facilities are available in the surrounding Donnycarney, Marino, Killester and Artane areas.\r\n\r\nThe area is particularly well served by public transport, with numerous Dublin Bus routes (N4 & 104) operating nearby and Killester DART station only 13 minutes walk away providing convenient rail connections to Dublin City Centre and surrounding coastal suburbs. The M1, M50 and Dublin Airport are also easily accessible.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate all this property has to offer."
      },
